   - flags[c2s[0]] is False;
   - any(flags.values()) and flags[c_first];
   - no flag below c_first;
   - c2_star == max(c < c_first).
4. Restore the v3 negatives:
   - B2 congested at every c2;
   - relocation({('S1140','S1141'):[(10,20)]}, ...)['flag'] is False;
   - c2_star({0.8:True, 0.81:False}, grid=[0.8, 0.81]) is None.
5. Find inputs where cell 35 is free at the lowest c2 (raise E15, lower E14). If none exist, report that to the author.
6. Before launch, or at latest before grid-run: get an author ruling on onset-transient relocation, for example requiring that the cell-35 binding run is not contiguous with the B2 congested region. Record it as a protocol addendum, not as a silent code change.

